    "section_faq_XeGrmV": {
      "type": "section-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "block_tak6ta": {
          "type": "block",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What should I consider before taking this product?",
            "text": "<p>Before using this product it is recommended that you consult your healthcare professional. If you are taking any medications, it’s important to discuss potential interactions with your healthcare provider. Do not use if tamper seal is damaged.</p>"
          }
        },
        "block_3MVhQ7": {
          "type": "block",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Where is this product manufactured and what product quality control tests are performed?",
            "text": "<p>Our BPC-157 products are manufactured in Nevada in a state-of-the-art, FDA-registered facility that meets or exceeds <a href=\"https://www.fda.gov/drugs/pharmaceutical-quality-resources/facts-about-current-good-manufacturing-practice-cgmp#:~:text=What%20is%20CGMP%3F,of%20manufacturing%20processes%20and%20facilities.\">current Good Manufacturing Practices (cGMP)</a>. Quality control testing is carried out at each stage of the manufacturing process, starting with rigorous raw material assessments and continuing through to finished product testing. </p><p>Our BPC-157 supplements are third-party tested by ISO certified, FDA registered laboratories for purity, potency and contaminates.</p>"
          }
        },
        "block_AKtNdP": {
          "type": "block",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is Apeiron Elementals BPC 157 third-party verified?",
            "text": "<p>Yes, our BPC-157 products are third-party tested for purity, quality and consistency.</p>"
          }
        },
        "block_caxTCm": {
          "type": "block",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Should I take this on an empty stomach or with food?",
            "text": "<p>Our BPC-157 supplement remains stable in the stomach. However, some reports suggest that the absorption of BPC-157 is enhanced when taken after a meal.</p>"
          }
        },
        "block_8WQY6L": {
          "type": "block",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What other supplements work synergistically with this product?",
            "text": "<p>BPC-157 works well alongside most other dietary supplements. Our favorite adds are TB4-Frag, Marine Collagen, High Potency EPA+DHA and Magnesium Glycinate. All of which can support recovery, repair and optimize resilience.</p>"
          }
        },
        "block_4XQyf9": {
          "type": "block",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is this product vegan?",
            "text": "<p>Yes, our BPC-157 products are also formulated without gluten, dairy, and soy.</p>"
          }
        },
        "block_3Rez4d": {
          "type": "block",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do you test for lipopolysaccharides or LPS?",
            "text": "<p>Yes! Our product is tested specifically for LPS. Levels have to be &lt;10 EU/mg to pass quality control.</p>"
          }
        },
        "block_V7dCWj": {
          "type": "block",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Are BPC 157 capsules bioavailable?",
            "text": "<p>Yes. Many peptides lack stability in the digestive tract and must be administered subcutaneously. However, BPC-157 is one of the few peptides that is stable, making it effective when taken orally. BPC-157 was identified as bioavailable being naturally present in human gastric juices. Our dosage of 500mcg per capsule offers similar benefits without the need for injections.</p>"
          }
        },
        "block_RMJWmN": {
          "type": "block",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How is your product different from other BPC 157 supplements?",
            "text": "<p>We've formulated a truly synergistic blend, combining full-strength BPC-157 (500mcg) with 200mg of CurcuPrime™ in each capsule. This blend is entirely unique, making it the only one of its kind available on the market.</p>"
          }
        },
        "block_CUzkg9": {
          "type": "block",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is the difference between BPC-157 Prime and your other BPC-157 products?",
            "text": "<p>Our BPC-157 Prime includes a highly bioavailable form of curcumin, called tetrahydrocurcumin. This combination offers additional benefits including: Improved acetylcholine production and protection, a more balanced inflammatory response from powerful antioxidant properties, and support of a healthy lipid profile.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
